Sort the .conf files ghc-pkg reads from a package db directory (solnix; upstream master still reads them unsorted,
utils/ghc-pkg/Main.hs). getDirectoryContents returns readdir order, which on ZFS differs for every fresh copy of the same
directory (measured: 4 copies of GHC 9.10.3's package.conf.d gave 4 orders in the regenerated package.cache), so two
builds of GHC shipped different package.cache files, and every unit-id FastString was interned in a different order.

--- utils/ghc-pkg/Main.hs.orig
+++ utils/ghc-pkg/Main.hs
@@ -923,7 +923,7 @@
                               warn ("Timestamp " ++ show tFile
                                 ++ " for " ++ file ++ rel)
             where
-                 confs = map (path </>) $ filter (".conf" `isSuffixOf`) fs
+                 confs = map (path </>) $ sort $ filter (".conf" `isSuffixOf`) fs
 
                  ignore_cache :: (FilePath -> IO ()) -> IO (PackageDB mode)
                  ignore_cache checkTime = do
